#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "模型故障＋边界输入＋cycles"
msgstr "Fault models + boundary inputs + cycles."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "IRQ数据发布"
msgstr "IRQ data publication"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "有界动作，无应用callback/无界扫描；index发布正确"
msgstr ""
"Bounded actions without application callbacks/unbounded scans; correct index"
" publication."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "竞态模型＋优先级负载＋实板"
msgstr "Race models + priority loads + physical Boards."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "completion观察"
msgstr "Completion observation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "从request读取已有状态；通知不构成结果权威"
msgstr "Read existing request state; notifications are not result authority."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "通知满/丢失＋取消/late IRQ"
msgstr "Full/lost notifications + cancellation/late IRQ."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "新实例"
msgstr "New instance"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "只增加该实例必需context/storage与只读绑定"
msgstr "Only necessary instance context/storage/read-only bindings."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "image delta/map＋配置说明"
msgstr "Image delta/maps + configuration explanation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "禁用功能"
msgstr "Disabled capability"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "不保留相应RAM和不可达方法引用"
msgstr "No retained RAM or unreachable method references."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "符号/section/实际ELF差分"
msgstr "Symbol/section/actual ELF differences."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:302
msgid ""
"正式优化 profile从 O2/Os/O3与 LTO比较中选少量组合，不沿用 CMake默认或发布器硬编码。按单个热点确有收益时局部优化；不全局启用 "
"fast-math或删掉必要边界检查。"
msgstr ""
"Select a few formal profiles by comparing O2/Os/O3/LTO, not CMake defaults "
"or hardcoded publishers. Apply hotspot-local optimizations where proven. No "
"global fast-math or deletion of necessary checks."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:304
msgid ""
"测量记录clock/waitstate、ABI/FPU、compiler、执行模式、负载、IRQ干扰、测量开销和ELF身份。不能把指令数当cycles、Native"
" wall time当MCU "
"deadline、观测最大值当严格WCET。DWT使用快照差值，profiler不能重置驱动使用的共同monotonic时基。"
msgstr ""
"Measurements record clocks/wait states, ABI/FPU, compiler, modes, loads, IRQ"
" interference, overhead and ELF identity. Instruction counts are not cycles;"
" Native wall time is not MCU deadlines; observed maxima are not strict WCET."
" DWT uses snapshot differences; profilers do not reset driver-shared "
"monotonic clocks."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:306
msgid ""
"绝对预算由参考benchmark与产品共同确定。平台先保证结构性约束和软件资源门禁；只有实测满足指定环境和负载，才承诺相应性能。架构不能无条件证明在所有负载、编译器和硬件上全局最优。"
msgstr ""
"Reference benchmarks and products define absolute budgets. The platform "
"establishes structural constraints/software gates first and promises "
"performance only when measured under stated conditions/loads. Architecture "
"cannot prove unconditional global optimality across workloads, compilers and"
" hardware."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:308
msgid "11. 工程工具、风格与管理"
msgstr "11. Tools, style and management"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:310
msgid ""
"默认 C11 production，公共 ABI保持 C；C++可用于 host tests，不作为 driver对象系统。正式工具用锁定 "
"ARM/Native compiler、CMake/Ninja/CTest、Python、clang-format/精选clang-"
"tidy和一个host测试框架。其他工具只有覆盖明确缺口时引入。"
msgstr ""
"Production defaults to C11/public C ABI. C++ may support host tests, not "
"driver object systems. Formal tools use locked ARM/Native compilers, "
"CMake/Ninja/CTest, Python, clang-format/selected clang-tidy and one host "
"framework. Other tools enter only for explicit gaps."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:312
msgid ""
"正式环境锁定版本与 OCI digest，源依赖另外锁定内容和许可。一个薄 "
"dev入口编排原生命令；本地与CI复用，不建立第二build/test/workflow engine。"
msgstr ""
"Lock formal versions/OCI digests and separately source contents/licenses. "
"One thin dev entry orchestrates native commands for local/CI; no second "
"build/test/workflow engine."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:314
msgid ""
"风格沿用根目录.clang-format/.editorconfig：80列、4空格、K&R attached braces和类型侧pointer "
"alignment。公共symbol延续模块前缀、type的_t后缀和既有命名；private实现static，header自足，整数/长度/序列化规则明确。vendor代码独立target，不通过全局关闭warnings掩盖own代码。"
msgstr ""
"Preserve root .clang-format/.editorconfig: 80 columns, four spaces, attached"
" K&R braces and type-side pointers. Keep module prefixes, _t types and "
"current naming; private code is static, headers self-contained and "
"integer/length/encoding rules explicit. Vendor targets stay separate; global"
" warning suppression never hides owned defects."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:316
msgid ""
"注释沿用反斜杠Doxygen、现有文件头与section/inline形式。public "
"header写完整参数和返回合同，source避免重复；调用context、阻塞和deadline起点、所有权、输出有效性、取消/结清及失败剩余状态用现有标签说明。共享规则放类型/模块contract，函数仅写差异。内部注释解释竞态、屏障、勘误和取舍。文件头保留作者/版本/日期等现有约定，Git补充历史追踪。具体规则和现有落实缺口见[工程手册第12节](engineering-"
"handbook.md#12-代码风格注释与静态检查)。"
msgstr ""
"Comments retain backslash Doxygen, file headers and section/inline forms. "
"Public headers define parameters/returns; sources avoid duplication. "
"Existing tags describe context, blocking/deadline origins, ownership, output"
" validity, cancel/settlement and residual failures. Shared rules live on "
"types/modules; functions state differences. Internals explain races, "
"barriers, errata and tradeoffs. Headers retain authors/versions/dates and "
"Git supplements history. See [handbook section 12](engineering-"
"handbook.md#12-代码风格注释与静态检查)."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:318
msgid ""
"状态码服务于caller可以执行的恢复动作；raw vendor诊断为可选detail。API不隐式格式化日志、不写全局last "
"error、不在IRQ调用全局用户handler。普通错误与invariant违约分别处理。"
msgstr ""
"Statuses support actionable caller recovery; vendor diagnostics are optional"
" detail. APIs do not format logs implicitly, write global last errors or "
"call global application handlers in IRQs. Ordinary errors and invariant "
"violations are distinct."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:320
msgid ""
"十人配置沿用职责投入，不绑定旧代码边界：TL1、core/io/os2、STM/GD "
"BSP2、器件/通信2、QA/HIL2、build/release1。每个维护域落实primary/backup。普通变更一个独立domain "
"reviewer；公共合同、IRQ/DMA、同步、持久化和发布链增加消费者/跨层review。"
msgstr ""
"The ten-person capacity follows responsibilities, not old code boundaries: "
"TL1, core/I/O/OS2, STM/GD BSP2, device/communications2, QA/HIL2, "
"build/release1. Each domain has primary/backup responsibility. Ordinary "
"changes need independent domain review; public contracts, IRQ/DMA, "
"synchronization, persistence and publishing add consumer/cross-layer review."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:322
msgid ""
"状态分为设计、实现、软件资格、硬件资格、发布资格。任务不以代码行、PR数、文档数量或测试数量完成。详见 [工程手册](engineering-"
"handbook.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Distinguish design, implementation, software, hardware and release "
"qualification. Code lines, PRs, pages and test counts do not close tasks. "
"See [engineering handbook](engineering-handbook.md)."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:324
msgid "12. 验证、交付与平台接入"
msgstr "12. Validation, delivery and integration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:326
msgid ""
"验证层次：fast local → PR集成 → nightly广度/负载 →专用HIL "
"→同工件晋升。检查选择依据契约与风险，配置、同步、公共API、linker/toolchain变化触发跨层检查。"
msgstr ""
"Validation layers: fast local → PR integration → nightly breadth/load → "
"dedicated HIL → same-artifact promotion. Contracts/risks drive selection; "
"configuration, synchronization, public APIs and linker/toolchain changes "
"trigger cross-layer checks."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:328
msgid ""
"核心不变量：REJECTED无借用；ACCEPTED的错误仍有归属；SETTLED后backend/DMA/IRQ/deferred不再访问request/buffer；caller回收还需consumer/adapter退出；request复用前排空旧源；一个bus仅一个wire-"
"active事务；stop先禁admission再排空；overflow/通知满不伪造成功；wait仍能推进drain且无lost-"
"wake；资源计划与实现一致。"
msgstr ""
"Core invariants: REJECTED retains no borrow; ACCEPTED failures remain owned;"
" after SETTLED no backend/DMA/IRQ/deferred access to the request/buffer "
"remains; reclamation also needs consumer/adapter exit; reuse drains old "
"sources; one wire-active transaction per bus; stop closes admission then "
"drains; overflow/full notifications cannot fake success; waits preserve "
"drain/protect against lost wakes; resource plans match implementations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:330
msgid ""
"模型测试覆盖partial start、late "
"IRQ、epoch复用、queue满、取消和deadline竞争、abort失败及stop重试。ARM真实链接覆盖startup/vector/strongIRQ、layout、ABI和资源。实板覆盖TC、DMA"
" drain、电气、屏蔽时间、高水位和长期负载，当前明确未执行。"
msgstr ""
"Models cover partial starts, late IRQs, epoch reuse, full queues, "
"cancel/deadline races, failed aborts and stop retries. Actual ARM links "
"cover startup/vectors/strong IRQs, layout, ABI and resources. Physical "
"testing covers TC, DMA drain, electrical behavior, masking duration, high-"
"water marks and sustained loads; currently not executed."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:332
msgid ""
"provenance证明输入/命令/输出绑定，hermetic证明只读声明输入，可复现证明独立clean "
"build字节相同。三者单独验收。正式产物从完整锁定输入构建，封存ELF/BIN/map/config/manifest；晋升同一hash，不在最后发布步骤重建另一个image。"
msgstr ""
"Provenance binds inputs/commands/outputs; hermeticity proves reading only "
"declared inputs; reproducibility proves identical independent clean-build "
"bytes. Accept them separately. Formal artifacts build from complete locked "
"inputs and seal ELF/BIN/maps/config/manifests. Promote identical hashes "
"without rebuilding at publication."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:334
msgid ""
"支持单元由 exact part、Board source/PCB revision、route、execution "
"mode、backend与resolved配置确定。source资料、编译/链接、model、physical、product负载分别记录。一个Board名称不代表全部外设已支持。"
msgstr ""
"Support units include exact part, Board source/PCB revision, routes, modes, "
"backend and resolved configuration. Source review, compile/link, models, "
"physical tests and product loads are separate evidence dimensions. Board "
"names do not imply all-peripheral support."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:336
msgid ""
"新Board交付少量硬件事实和必要电气hook；新SoC交付真实provider/startup/clock/IRQ/memory/SDK；新器件交付窄transport与器件逻辑；新协议交付纯core与adapter；外部工程交付assembly/main/tasks/policy。典型流程和源码SDK升级见"
" [接入契约](integration-contracts.md)。"
msgstr ""
"New Boards provide small fact sets/electrical hooks; SoCs provide actual "
"providers/startup/clocks/IRQs/memory/SDKs; devices provide narrow "
"transport/logic; protocols provide pure cores/adapters; products provide "
"assembly/main/tasks/policy. See [integration contracts](integration-"
"contracts.md) for workflows and SDK upgrades."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:338
msgid "13. 实施顺序与退出条件"
msgstr "13. Implementation order and exit conditions"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:340
msgid ""
"每批按新公共合同原子更新实现、caller、测试和文档；外部examples更新独立SDK "
"pin。既有接口允许直接删除；持久化数据若已部署，仍需独立迁移与回滚政策。"
msgstr ""
"Each batch atomically updates implementations, callers, tests and docs to "
"new contracts. External examples update SDK pins separately. Old interfaces "
"may be deleted directly; deployed persistence still requires "
"migration/rollback policy."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "批次"
msgstr "Batch"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "内容"
msgstr "Content"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "软件退出条件"
msgstr "Software exit condition"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B0"
msgstr "B0"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "设计冻结、需求/风险、基准workload与预算schema"
msgstr ""
"Freeze design, requirements/risks, reference workloads and budget schemas."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "一套可评审合同，未实现/未测量状态准确"
msgstr ""
"One reviewable contract set with truthful unimplemented/unmeasured states."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B1"
msgstr "B1"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "正式工具、源码包、schema配置、最小image/target"
msgstr ""
"Formal tools, source packages, schema configuration and minimum "
"images/targets."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "两SoC真实最小ELF；错误输入真实拒绝；一个有效配置"
msgstr ""
"Actual minimum ELFs for two SoCs; real invalid-input rejection; one resolved"
" configuration."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B2"
msgstr "B2"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "CPU/clock/memory/启动与固定GPIO"
msgstr "CPU/clocks/memory/startup and fixed GPIO."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "三Board基础组合；直接/batch路径；安全初值及输入身份一致"
msgstr ""
"Three-Board base combinations, direct/batch paths, consistent safe "
"values/input identity."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B3"
msgstr "B3"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "请求、UART/SPI/I2C/Flash及EXTI/PWM/ADC/IWDG首发模式"
msgstr "Requests, UART/SPI/I2C/Flash and first EXTI/PWM/ADC/IWDG modes."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "cancel/deadline/drain与不可逆效果不变量；按实际支持模式链接和故障回归"
msgstr ""
"Cancel/deadline/drain and irreversible-effect invariants; actual mode-"
"specific linking/fault regressions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B4"
msgstr "B4"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "按对象OS storage、通用器件/组件、外部examples"
msgstr ""
"Per-object OS storage, shared devices/components and external examples."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "真实外部consumer；业务不进入平台；未用资源不驻留"
msgstr ""
"Actual external consumers, no internal business logic or unused resident "
"resources."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B5"
msgstr "B5"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "静态分析、资源/性能工具、hermetic/reproducible、HIL准备"
msgstr ""
"Static analysis, resource/performance tools, hermetic/reproducible builds "
"and HIL preparation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "软件门禁、独立重建、真实工件准入；物理结果仍未执行"
msgstr ""
"Software gates, independent rebuilds and actual artifact admission; physical"
" results still unexecuted."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B6"
msgstr "B6"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "新候选与迁移收束"
msgstr "New candidates and migration closure."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "新源码资格与交付证据完整；旧入口删除；支持范围真实"
msgstr ""
"Complete new-source qualification/evidence, removed old entries and truthful"
" support scope."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:352
msgid ""
"具体依赖与主责见 {download}`执行清单 <next-generation-"
"execution.csv>`。十人3–6个月用于范围受控的迭代，不能在此窗口默认完成所有外设、自动拓扑、动态设备系统、低功耗、MPU、安全更新和企业LTS。"
msgstr ""
"See {download}`execution checklist <next-generation-execution.csv>` for "
"dependencies/domain owners. Ten people over 3–6 months deliver controlled "
"scope, not automatically every peripheral, topology solver, dynamic device "
"system, low power, MPU, secure updates or enterprise LTS."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:354
msgid ""
"以下是十人投入下的排期假设，任务依赖和退出证据优先于日历。各provider首个切片即带故障验证、格式/warning和最小资源预算，B5负责扩大与收束，不能把检查推迟到最后。"
msgstr ""
"The following schedule assumes ten-person capacity; dependencies/evidence "
"take precedence over calendars. Each provider’s first slice includes faults,"
" style/warnings and minimal budgets. B5 expands/closes checks rather than "
"deferring them until the end."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "时间窗"
msgstr "Window"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "主线及并行工作"
msgstr "Main and parallel work"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "阶段结果"
msgstr "Stage outcome"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "第1–2周"
msgstr "Weeks 1–2"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B0；工具与QA同时准备最小workload和锁定环境"
msgstr "B0; tools/QA prepare minimum workloads and locked environments."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "首发模式、资源口径、失败/借用合同明确"
msgstr ""
"Explicit initial modes, resource accounting and failure/borrow contracts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "第3–6周"
msgstr "Weeks 3–6"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B1；两BSP准备精确startup/memory，接口组建立请求模型"
msgstr ""
"B1; BSPs prepare exact startup/memory while interfaces establish request "
"models."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "外部消费到两SoC最小ELF的完整切片"
msgstr "Complete external-consumer-to-minimum-ELF slices on two SoCs."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "第7–12周"
msgstr "Weeks 7–12"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B2及B3基础路径；两BSP并行GPIO/UART，QA同步故障模型"
msgstr ""
"B2 and base B3; parallel GPIO/UART BSP work with concurrent QA fault models."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "三板基础通讯软件基线与资源报告"
msgstr ""
"Three-Board base communications software baseline and resource reports."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "第13–18周"
msgstr "Weeks 13–18"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B3工业模式及B4；器件/通信组迁移组件和六个基础examples"
msgstr ""
"Industrial B3 and B4; device/communications teams migrate components and six"
" base examples."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "首发EXTI/PWM/ADC/IWDG及明确I2C范围，裸机/FreeRTOS消费闭合"
msgstr ""
"Initial EXTI/PWM/ADC/IWDG and explicit I2C scope; closed bare-metal/FreeRTOS"
" consumption."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "第19–24周"
msgstr "Weeks 19–24"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "B5/B6；QA与构建组收束门禁、离线重建、HIL准备和旧路径删除"
msgstr ""
"B5/B6; QA/build close gates, offline rebuilds, HIL preparation and old "
"paths."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:0
msgid "范围受控的新软件候选、精确支持记录和可用工装准备"
msgstr ""
"Controlled-scope software candidates, exact support records and usable "
"tooling."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:364
msgid "第3个月基线与第6个月候选承担不同范围。实板接入后按实际产物继续物理验收；硬件依赖未关闭时保留未执行状态，不用缩小测试范围来维持日历承诺。"
msgstr ""
"Month-three baselines and month-six candidates have different scopes. After "
"hardware connects, perform physical acceptance on actual artifacts. Unclosed"
" hardware dependencies remain not executed; do not shrink tests to preserve "
"calendar promises."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:366
msgid ""
"首个验证切片是固定GPIO及caller-"
"owned请求状态模型，再实现一个必要的真实UART或SPI执行路径。DMA列为独立模式与资格项，不能因为SDK提供函数而计完成。软件候选与产品实板资格分开交付。"
msgstr ""
"Begin with fixed GPIO and caller-owned request state, then implement one "
"necessary actual UART/SPI path. DMA modes/qualification remain separate; SDK"
" functions do not establish completion. Software candidates and product "
"physical qualification are delivered separately."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:368
msgid "14. 会删除或不引入的默认复杂度"
msgstr "14. Default complexity removed or excluded"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:370
msgid "逐GPIO的通用注册/owner/ref/generation及热路径字符串查询。"
msgstr ""
"Per-GPIO generic registration/owner/ref/generation and hot-path string "
"lookup."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:371
msgid "每实例复制的可变OOP接口、raw getter与managed引用并存的长期兼容。"
msgstr ""
"Per-instance mutable OOP tables and permanent raw-getter/managed-reference "
"coexistence."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:372
msgid "未选模式的DMA handle、最大legacy copy buffer、全类型最大对象池。"
msgstr ""
"Unselected DMA handles, maximum legacy copy buffers and all-class maximum "
"pools."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:373
msgid "必须经过统一OSAL的所有kernel功能、通用executor、隐藏worker和默认completion队列。"
msgstr ""
"Mandatory OSAL traversal for all kernel functions, generic executors, hidden"
" workers and default completion queues."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:374
msgid "重复配置事实、多重overlay、生成业务流程的DSL、所有引脚自动求解器。"
msgstr ""
"Duplicate configuration facts, multiple overlays, generated business DSLs "
"and all-pin automatic solvers."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:375
msgid "重复构建/发布入口、只看test count的资格、与实际产物不一致的PASS报告。"
msgstr ""
"Duplicate build/release entries, count-only qualification and PASS reports "
"for different artifacts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:376
msgid "为名称现代化而拆仓、增加目录转发层或一次引入多个构建/包管理体系。"
msgstr ""
"Repository splits, forwarding directories or multiple build/package systems "
"introduced only to modernize names."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/next-generation-platform.md:378
msgid ""
"新方案保留的是实际问题所需的状态和证据：固定资源规划、真实请求借用、故障与drain、明确context、实际内存/时序、可重复工程与外部产品边界。"
msgstr ""
"Retain the state/evidence real problems need: fixed planning, genuine "
"borrows, faults/draining, explicit contexts, actual memory/timing and "
"repeatable engineering with external product boundaries."
